      "text": "LLMs are designed to *sound* smart, which is not quite the same thing as actually being smart\n\nwe all know enough bullshitters to know the difference\n\nplanning, memory, reasoning, self-reflection… all key steps to get real intelligence\n\n(to be clear, smartest ppl working on it)",
