      "text": "💼 @scale_ai is releasing the easiest way for enterprises to build custom LLMs using Scale's Data Engine.\n\nThe biggest challenge for fine-tuning is data—diverse prompt-response datasets are Scale's specialty\n\nBuild your own domain-specific model 👇\n\nhttps://t.co/179TE4TXQD",
